{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00388","headline":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享昊天乐章 九 · 不详","name":"郊庙歌辞 武后大享昊天乐章 九","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荷恩承顾托，执契恭临抚。\n庙畧静边荒，天兵耀神武。\n有截资先化，无爲遵旧矩。\n祯符降昊穹，大业光寰宇。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00388.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00388","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}